Error [E0307]: this `if` over `Int (a whole number)` has no `else` arm — range arms can't cover every value
  --> tests/ui/result_handler_non_result.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     value ? ok -> print("ok") ! error -> print("error")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Int (a whole number)` has infinitely many values; range arms only cover a subset
 Fix: add `else -> { … }` to handle values not matched by any range
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0307

Error [E0305]: this pattern belongs to a fallible result, not Int
  --> tests/ui/result_handler_non_result.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     value ? ok -> print("ok") ! error -> print("error")
    |           ^^^^
 Why: use `== Ok(...)` or `== Err(...)` on `T !E`
 Fix: check the type of the value being tested
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0305

